            "name": "Cancels a carrier booking.\n",
            "description": {
              "content": "This view is called by syndication partners that have previously reserved a load.\n\nThe process cancels the reservation and puts it in an abandoned status, because the carrier “dropped” the load.    \nThe carrier needs to be the one that previously reserved the load, otherwise an error will be returned.\n\nIf you need to cancel a Quote that hasn't been accepted yet, please use the Quote `/cancel` endpoint.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
